 \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-6,\\,-2,\\,8⟩$\nand \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}[\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}⟨-6,\\,-2,\\,8⟩-⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,\\,-1,\\,4⟩-⟨4,\\,3,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,-4,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98158/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0333b70a-2ede-5c8d-b298-4d25ae4d4667"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98158"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection/6d15a5d4bd1158dba2c6621617d9d0501b9f97b1dd1c3c8eb44606bcab6d73bd" :answer/id #uuid "2b88247b-efa8-5707-8141-0471f67b3b57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{e}^{2}+3,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2+9,\\,12⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection/b34f1319e21d6c85fc87b3fcedea8cef7234cb8562ffb223f5a31bb214b83daa" :answer/id #uuid "efcf0520-67f5-5e70-ba51-5ed3a160cb91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨7{e}^{2},\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection/4306469d83b6cc379b72e9745ba84e3a9573c1349650163f02b9f115482e48f3" :answer/id #uuid "5b26e7a4-2aaf-5884-9a12-bffbf3a52418" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2{e}^{2}-7,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2+3,\\,9⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection/111be08ce8014a9df92aa4dcc9be5f3937fb15a04784b3cd5054b5b1fe087ee6" :answer/id #uuid "86734ecb-63a6-548e-a852-42993ab3d2ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2{e}^{2},\\,6\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,21⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection/d0e88eab5c2504e9e93837fd67afb1c2f0666981bd8150252b4aacda903bc20b" :answer/id #uuid "597c5a08-6352-59ba-9235-d2a6dd454e89" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "59a96ac9-5380-5377-93d8-20719ba9aacf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-98157/selection/d0e88eab5c2504e9e93837fd67afb1c2f0666981bd8150252b4aacda903bc20b" :answer-field/choices ["q-98157/selection/6d15a5d4bd1158dba2c6621617d9d0501b9f97b1dd1c3c8eb44606bcab6d73bd" "q-98157/selection/b34f1319e21d6c85fc87b3fcedea8cef7234cb8562ffb223f5a31bb214b83daa" "q-98157/selection/4306469d83b6cc379b72e9745ba84e3a9573c1349650163f02b9f115482e48f3" "q-98157/selection/111be08ce8014a9df92aa4dcc9be5f3937fb15a04784b3cd5054b5b1fe087ee6" "q-98157/selection/d0e88eab5c2504e9e93837fd67afb1c2f0666981bd8150252b4aacda903bc20b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-98157" :question/id #uuid "a8b8f7a3-b02e-51d2-ba01-d642e151c57b" :question/math-academy-id "q-98157" :question/problem "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨{e}^{2}-1,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,3⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨3,\\,-1,\\,5⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=2{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+3{\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[2f(t)+3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+3{\\int }_{0}^{2}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2⟨{e}^{2}-1,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,3⟩+3⟨3,\\,-1,\\,5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}-2,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2,\\,6⟩+⟨9,\\,-3,\\,15⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{e}^{2}+7,\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2-3,\\,21⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98157/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0333b70a-2ede-5c8d-b298-4d25ae4d4667"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98157"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection/1451c14afb1535c62c63073f2c665b07ff26b095b76cbd38fd37722897218df4" :answer/id #uuid "6d2384a4-46b6-56ab-85ab-a401eee400fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-7,\\,0,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection/f58c5e4684a301a968a1bf86e1d1d9bfdc623f55d5593d40add463de31d3bcbd" :answer/id #uuid "ae3bfcf2-b933-5658-9820-d58e10a338b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection/08089eab495c90ac6ab37152e1cdf8718633ba242d02a5502eb941a5a9c6c43a" :answer/id #uuid "641d742d-81db-59f2-912a-cecebf169ea0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-6,\\,3,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection/1b19a03ff87bdb131fe83601b2b31ebe619f91fbbbe883e39938d3915b7a4f45" :answer/id #uuid "44f22993-ae47-5fd9-9e99-3dc3b24dd433" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5,\\,0,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection/99e92d5b79d6226e6f457c6e764675e95ee3722606082bc240f46c48fa3cecaf" :answer/id #uuid "e289dbf5-db4f-5ed1-b5be-94293346d546" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5,\\,4,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "31e676c9-4363-518f-9d29-00b650a91ff3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-98189/selection/f58c5e4684a301a968a1bf86e1d1d9bfdc623f55d5593d40add463de31d3bcbd" :answer-field/choices ["q-98189/selection/1451c14afb1535c62c63073f2c665b07ff26b095b76cbd38fd37722897218df4" "q-98189/selection/f58c5e4684a301a968a1bf86e1d1d9bfdc623f55d5593d40add463de31d3bcbd" "q-98189/selection/08089eab495c90ac6ab37152e1cdf8718633ba242d02a5502eb941a5a9c6c43a" "q-98189/selection/1b19a03ff87bdb131fe83601b2b31ebe619f91fbbbe883e39938d3915b7a4f45" "q-98189/selection/99e92d5b79d6226e6f457c6e764675e95ee3722606082bc240f46c48fa3cecaf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-98189" :question/id #uuid "633f6eed-41c4-5a19-93c4-936a8f7a0d9d" :question/math-academy-id "q-98189" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩-{⟨3t,\\,-t,\\,-2t⟩|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,-3⟩-⟨6,\\,-2,\\,-4⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-98189/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98189"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98184/selection/b8b0234300cf52230e519ec5ede62744e660114ce39530b7cd71a7898311a798" :answer/id #uuid "977856e0-7a30-5322-b0e5-13aa1843fabd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,\\,-4,\\,10⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98184/selection/df957e4a8f20111e5b6856415e3cb907094eee6ef0335a851a05162ddd14fdb5" :answer/id #uuid "f641fce8-2f17-58d7-b46a-d4ce1ed15109" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-4,\\,8,\\,-10⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98184/selection/ffd0d2ece45ed13cf93