e, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{0}\\frac{2}{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot ⟨6,\\,-12,\\,15⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-8,\\,10⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98184/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98184"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection/95872345c7ff320c80e5de8c1ce8074d42bbbcdff5452af0c8229ae7ee864d63" :answer/id #uuid "6f073194-9b90-5664-9fe3-dcfe05be1e76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,\\,-8,\\,6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection/79142d64eafa2ba3611939c88ed7b9b76d41f25932aaa0ca97195c8e1fa687a5" :answer/id #uuid "e9410dbf-ca01-596f-8fca-fdc82207e4c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-3,\\,5,\\,-8⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection/9e9883bfb3b0c5f2a0470887cdbc0311274e9bd4be838e82f2218282287c10a9" :answer/id #uuid "daeb742a-e857-548f-916c-2e2cf685e8fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-8,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection/cf1ad9f5c212934cf5cc983bc00759b9ab741641d7ee788364a10b483b777581" :answer/id #uuid "13600e13-c1e5-5040-b1da-242c153f6db3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,-6,\\,-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection/de370abcafceb7dd3750055839f47698a6169902aa202a5b35a66fcc39e6ba85" :answer/id #uuid "76dc16c2-e0ca-5e8d-ab9c-53e1e80f1288" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,\\,-5,\\,-4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0da5e162-91cf-5b3a-8591-2b5a9c76e8a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129180/selection/cf1ad9f5c212934cf5cc983bc00759b9ab741641d7ee788364a10b483b777581" :answer-field/choices ["q-129180/selection/95872345c7ff320c80e5de8c1ce8074d42bbbcdff5452af0c8229ae7ee864d63" "q-129180/selection/79142d64eafa2ba3611939c88ed7b9b76d41f25932aaa0ca97195c8e1fa687a5" "q-129180/selection/9e9883bfb3b0c5f2a0470887cdbc0311274e9bd4be838e82f2218282287c10a9" "q-129180/selection/cf1ad9f5c212934cf5cc983bc00759b9ab741641d7ee788364a10b483b777581" "q-129180/selection/de370abcafceb7dd3750055839f47698a6169902aa202a5b35a66fcc39e6ba85"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129180" :question/id #uuid "45860eb7-c017-50b3-9d85-f85e3f455c69" :question/math-academy-id "q-129180" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{3}^{0}\\frac{3}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-2,\\,4,\\,\\frac{2}{3}⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-2,\\,4,\\,\\frac{2}{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-\\frac{2}{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{0}\\frac{3}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot ⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-\\frac{2}{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129180/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129180"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129266/selection/9ab396d2fb849bbf8c1a5dc6d30d813219b477c2a08b95734dfc84f624f19bf0" :answer/id #uuid "203facf1-32a0-53ba-812c-701debe54e1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,\\,4,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129266/selection/17fadfcd6cf78cb9a8eff948efa80c75c4ea9847d5e5cc8c4ead5fcbadeaaaad" :answer/id #uuid "ba031436-a40e-5bac-987a-d714ddcf0a1b" :answer/type :answer.type/