t{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)+⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{1}^{0}⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩+⟨t,\\,-t,\\,0⟩{|}_{1}^{0} \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩+⟨-1,\\,1,\\,0⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,-2,\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-129266/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129266"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection/c256613526e455f58fb17f162e7cdbc332403285c71fcd155bea76848899183c" :answer/id #uuid "c3b24d1f-919c-5180-8fcd-2c09ba29098e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨7,\\,8,\\,-5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection/4cdbfb114103889a4dfed76e78be0d65d958920261fe032257a750e4d4387db0" :answer/id #uuid "f851d6a0-665c-5524-abbe-076880657860" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨10,\\,7,\\,6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection/b5444dbb1696a75f5c4fb54eeb7a07470eb5a73a416996faa0176fec33810423" :answer/id #uuid "b1a1283e-5a16-5e7a-a4c7-790c499d7b62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨8,\\,7,\\,5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection/6a9a621c1b1f255ab95623376e6b695d83b78ebbb57ae375d29e57d69d7d79e0" :answer/id #uuid "55d65eb9-6a18-5261-8a4c-550840ec3f76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,\\,-3,\\,5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection/2da959c8003bdab7fb5ba5776a6c465eb3014640dc799a0ae6a9e8bbfb737bc5" :answer/id #uuid "36b3ed06-e0e8-50f5-83bf-638d44f209e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨10,\\,7,\\,7⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98185/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "253a6143-5c00-520c-935b-3e2d