^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩-⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98267/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d5287f63-6d1a-5710-8a71-df5d1ba09a00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98267"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129270/selection/c0638f6399b405ae24b08871cab6c73a8d75cc7e0224d664c66d593a2be95622" :answer/id #uuid "ec7f0748-e92b-51bb-b8b0-425a4689ecaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,\\,-3,\\,15⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129270/selection/255721bc2551952397f721c9fc0784dc1d46b194597d62b426ed687959d7490a" :answer/id #uuid "7a30f880-6499-5a68-8e7b-8ef9cc3127c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,4,\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129270/selection/414839ae7fd44b28811e0a47ace84547fa6184bfdc53268f29f5e691b6eea2d7" :answer/id #uuid "21944836-be42-59ed-88da-16d9ff9a49f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,-8,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129270/selection/7af0bfc59194bc6099a81a41643e94a7d55ae1c2c7a479b59424d6fb9868f0f2" :answer/id #uuid "12d81ca4-1646-5cce-881a-2a24374550eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,0,\\,12⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129270/selection/82fb82a500d